      "message": "For example, noop_backing_dev_info appears as added new here but not in the original commit. The symbol was originally added to the main branch in a new `abi_gki_aarch64_amlogic` symbol file. That has not been cherry-picked into this respin, so this commit is the one that updates the ABI XML.\n\nThe same thing is true of `dentry_path_raw` and `pagecache_write_end`.\n\nI\u0027m not going to check any others.\n\nThere is another minor difference in the commit messages:\n\n```\n-  \u0027int security_inode_init_security(struct inode *, struct inode *, const struct qstr *, const initxattrs, void *)\u0027\n+  \u0027int security_inode_init_security(struct inode *, struct inode *, const struct qstr *, initxattrs, void *)\u0027\n```\n\nThis is thanks to an `abitidy` change that removes useless qualifiers from parameters.",
